    "codingMaxHistoryMessages": 12,
    "codingMaxPathChars": 512,
    "codingMaxRequestChars": 500,
    "providerErrorMaxChars": 10000,
    "agentActivityMaxEntries": 100,
    "transcriptionPrompt": "Transcribe only the words spoken in the audio. Do not paraphrase, complete, or convert a request into a self-answer. Preserve clearly spoken technical product names exactly. Technical vocabulary: Spring Boot, Spring Security, dependency injection, Hibernate, JPA, Java, JavaScript, TypeScript, React, React.js, Node.js, Python, FastAPI, OpenAI, Copilot, Groq, API, REST API, Microservices, SQL, PostgreSQL, MySQL, Docker, Kubernetes, AWS, Azure, GitHub. If a word is uncertain, return the audible wording instead of inventing a correction.",
    "meetingTranscriptionPrompt": "Transcribe only words that are actually audible, verbatim, and in the original language or languages spoken. Preserve language switches and word order. Never translate, paraphrase, complete, explain, answer, summarize, or repeat words that were not spoken. Use the natural writing system for each language without forcing transliteration. If no speech is intelligible, return an empty transcript."
